# From a 640 point wide window the timeline keeps T3 Code's 48 point padding
# beside its lane, so the minimap stays shown in that gutter and never covers
# message text, here with the sidebar and the side panel open in a window just
# wider than that. Hidden marks would stay in the accessibility tree, so the
# screenshot is the evidence that they show.
fixture /long-conversation/minimap
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Long conversation" 20000
expect "Review section 14, input 0." 20000
window 660 760
expect "この発言へ移動: Review section 14, input 0."
expect_apart "この発言へ移動:*" "message.*"
screenshot narrow
press "この発言へ移動: Review section 5, input 0."
expect "Review section 5, input 0."
expect_apart "この発言へ移動:*" "message.*"
screenshot jumped
